\section{Results and Analysis}
\label{sec:results-analysis}

To rigorously evaluate TERRA GraphRAG, we adopt an ablation-first empirical methodology. Rather than presenting aggregated metrics that obscure internal component dynamics, we first dissect the architecture into its constituent mechanisms to establish causal contributions. We then evaluate multi-hop evolutionary reasoning via pairwise win rates and lexical recall, examine factual precision and safety firewalling across the complete \numTotalEvals-evaluation benchmark, profile stage-level latency distributions, and conduct formal statistical significance and power audits.

